WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:22.933
Dear little Salamence, first we’re going to catch you,

2
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.933
then attack the twerps and steal Pikachu, so don't worry.

3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.400
Fear? No fear! None. Fret not! Everything is just as it should be.

4
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.433
-Huh?

5
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.900
Wait! The idea of making you fall asleep and then catching you

6
00:00:46.966 --> 00:00:50.133
had never ever crossed my mind! What did I just say?

7
00:00:50.199 --> 00:00:52.400
Jessie! Pretend like you fell asleep!

8
00:00:52.466 --> 00:00:56.266
Oh, good night.

9
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.433
All right, you two. Do something, quick!

10
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.966
-Any ideas?

11
00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.666
Jessie, use the Happy Face! Stick that sucker on!

12
00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:14.233
Have a nice day!

13
00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:22.100
- Success!
- Yeah!

14
00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:34.866
Huh? What? Wait! Uh-oh!

15
00:01:34.933 --> 00:01:36.899
Our Happy Face is on the fritz!

16
00:01:36.966 --> 00:01:39.833
Not only that, I think it's broken, too!

17
00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.100
-Argh!

18
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:43.666
-I’m out of here!

19
00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:45.899
Ka-boom!

20
00:01:58.633 --> 00:02:00.899
- Meowth.
- Pumpkaboo.

21
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.933
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

22
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.500
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

23
00:02:10.566 --> 00:02:13.033
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

24
00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

25
00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:19.299
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

26
00:02:19.366 --> 00:02:22.033
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

27
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

28
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

29
00:02:28.433 --> 00:02:30.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

30
00:02:30.933 --> 00:02:33.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

31
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.600
Continuing their journey to Coumarine City,

32
00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.933
our heroes have stopped for a little rest at a nearby Pokémon Center.

33
00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:53.933
Hello there!

34
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.366
Wigglytuff! Wigglytuff!

35
00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.100
Oh, no, Wigglytuff!

36
00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.433
-You okay after that fall?

37
00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.633
Tuff!

38
00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.633
Hm!

39
00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.600
Tuff? Wigglytuff!

40
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:14.266
-Not again!

41
00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:16.700
- Are you all right?
- Na-na-na?

42
00:03:16.766 --> 00:03:19.966
Wigglytuff! You’ve taken another nasty fall!

43
00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.666
Tuff!

44
00:03:21.733 --> 00:03:25.066
- I wish you’d be more careful.
- Wiggly!

45
00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:29.133
- See, Wigglytuff just started here.
- So this is brand-new for you.

46
00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.366
- Wigglytuff!
- Please don’t worry.

47
00:03:31.433 --> 00:03:34.266
You’ll get used to it in no time.

48
00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:35.733
-Tuff?

49
00:03:41.633 --> 00:03:42.966
What’s happened?!

50
00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:47.366
-It’s a Linoone and a Bidoof, too!

51
00:03:47.433 --> 00:03:50.200
- What’s wrong?
- Don’t worry! They’ll be all right!

52
00:03:50.266 --> 00:03:52.733
Okay, I’ll go ahead and treat Bidoof.

53
00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:55.533
Wigglytuff, will you please take care of Linoone?

54
00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.133
Tuff! Wigglytuff!

55
00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.333
Oh, no! There’s no need to be in a rush!

56
00:04:01.399 --> 00:04:04.399
- Wigglytuff!
- Is there any way I can help out?

57
00:04:04.466 --> 00:04:06.100
Yeah, me too!

58
00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:09.866
-Tuff! Tuff!

59
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.500
How is it?

60
00:04:12.566 --> 00:04:17.566
Luckily, you just overdid it a little bit. Don’t worry. You’ll be fine soon!

61
00:04:18.766 --> 00:04:21.300
- I want to help you out!
- Pika!

62
00:04:21.366 --> 00:04:24.433
- Me, too!
- Thank you all very much!

63
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.033
Okay! Clemontic Gear on!

64
00:04:28.099 --> 00:04:30.933
Activating Aipom Arm!

65
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.233
Huh?

66
00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.933
Now, what did you do to get hurt, Bidoof?

67
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.200
Pika! Pikachu!

68
00:04:36.266 --> 00:04:38.733
-Huh?

69
00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.300
Uh-oh!

70
00:04:40.366 --> 00:04:43.733
Again? I could use a little bit of help, please.

71
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.700
Of course!

72
00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:50.333
What is their condition?

73
00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.066
- Badly injured.
- They need help, stat!

74
00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:55.966
I understand. You, take that gurney, please!

75
00:04:56.033 --> 00:04:57.033
Right!

76
00:04:59.466 --> 00:05:01.933
If the science twerp is here, then...

77
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.133
The twerp and his Pikachu must be somewhere close.

78
00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.466
I like it when things work out right.

79
00:05:09.466 --> 00:05:11.400
You’ll be just fine!

80
00:05:11.466 --> 00:05:14.366
- Clemont, look out!
- Ah!

81
00:05:14.433 --> 00:05:16.966
-Wigglytuff!

82
00:05:21.366 --> 00:05:23.333
What happened?

83
00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.900
Is everybody all right?!

84
00:05:27.233 --> 00:05:30.400
- Hang tough, old chum!
- Can you hear me?

85
00:05:30.466 --> 00:05:34.066
- Just what do you call this?
- These are precious patients!

86
00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:35.633
Wigglytuff!

87
00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.833
Oh! Forgive us.

88
00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.866
-Huh? What? Again?

89
00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:50.400
We need to hurry. It needs treatment right away!

90
00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:02.333
Everyone! Your Pokémon are all ready to go now!

91
00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.900
Thank you for waiting! Your Teddiursa is much better.

92
00:06:05.966 --> 00:06:07.633
Thank you so very much!

93
00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.766
- Eta! Eta!
- Wigglytuff!

94
00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:11.599
Argh!

95
00:06:15.933 --> 00:06:18.799
Oh, Wigglytuff!

96
00:06:18.866 --> 00:06:20.200
Wigglytuff!

97
00:06:20.266 --> 00:06:22.633
Eta!

98
00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.299
Wigglytuff, Wigglytuff!

99
00:06:25.366 --> 00:06:26.633
Wigglytuff.

100
00:06:28.366 --> 00:06:32.066
Pardon me for asking, but how did Teddiursa get injured?

101
00:06:32.133 --> 00:06:34.633
I’m not sure. It’s a mystery.

102
00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.799
Teddiursa was playing. The same way it does every day in the yard.

103
00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:43.933
Suddenly this Salamence came swooping in out of nowhere

104
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.500
and it was acting completely out of control!

105
00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:52.799
- Wow! A Salamence!
- Pika! Pika!

106
00:06:52.866 --> 00:06:56.366
So, it was acting out of control for no reason?

107
00:06:56.433 --> 00:07:00.700
Something must have happened. Tell us more about Salamence’s appearance.

108
00:07:00.766 --> 00:07:03.766
Do you think there was anything unusual about it?

109
00:07:03.833 --> 00:07:09.000
Appearance? Let’s see! It did seem to be in some kind of pain.

110
00:07:09.066 --> 00:07:12.533
Now, let’s see. Perhaps it was injured or sick.

111
00:07:12.599 --> 00:07:16.900
If that’s true, someone needs to find and help it or it’ll happen again!

112
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:18.233
Right!

113
00:07:19.866 --> 00:07:23.766
- You can count on me.
- Tuff! Tuff!

114
00:07:34.933 --> 00:07:36.633
Wigglytuff!

115
00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:42.466
Pika, Pika? Pika, Pika, Pikachu!

116
00:07:42.533 --> 00:07:43.633
Wigglytuff?

117
00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:47.066
Pika, Pikachu!

118
00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.133
Pika! Pika?

119
00:07:50.366 --> 00:07:53.333
Wiggly, Wigglytuff!

120
00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.933
- Tuff! Tuff!
- Pika, Pikachu!

121
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.500
- Pika!
- Wigglytuff.

122
00:07:59.566 --> 00:08:01.433
Pika! Pikachu!

123
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.599
Pika, Pika, Pika!

124
00:08:04.666 --> 00:08:07.066
Our big chance to catch Pikachu’s here.

125
00:08:07.133 --> 00:08:09.733
And we’ll grab that Wigglytuff as a bonus.

126
00:08:09.799 --> 00:08:12.933
It’s payback time for that knock on my noggin!

127
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.433
- Hm!
- Pikachu! Wigglytuff!

128
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.433
There you two are.

129
00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:21.900
Wigglytuff, Nurse Joy is looking for you.

130
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.833
She really cares a lot about you, you know.

131
00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.000
- Why don't you go back?
- Pikachu!

132
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.933
Tuff? Wigglytuff? Tuff.

133
00:08:34.933 --> 00:08:37.799
I’m going to head back now, 'cause I’m starving!

134
00:08:37.866 --> 00:08:40.366
- Pika! Pika!
- Wiggly!

135
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.033
Who’s that Pokémon?

136
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.066
It’s Salamence!

137
00:09:01.233 --> 00:09:04.133
So they still can’t find Salamence, huh?

138
00:09:04.199 --> 00:09:08.600
No such luck. Officer Jenny’s helping out, but nothing.

139
00:09:08.666 --> 00:09:12.366
You know, Wigglytuff’s convinced it can’t do its job.

140
00:09:12.433 --> 00:09:15.366
It takes everyone time to get used to a new job.

141
00:09:15.433 --> 00:09:16.766
Yeah, you’re right.

142
00:09:16.833 --> 00:09:20.333
But Wigglytuff seems to be taking its mistakes personally.

143
00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.566
Pika, Pika.

144
00:09:21.633 --> 00:09:25.766
Actually, Wigglytuff should be grateful. It has so many friends.

145
00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:28.600
- I guess you're right.
- Na-na-na!

146
00:09:28.666 --> 00:09:30.666
Wow, look at this!

147
00:09:33.033 --> 00:09:35.566
Hey, everyone, it’s about Wigglytuff!

148
00:09:35.633 --> 00:09:38.633
- Please, may I take a look at this?
- Sure you can.

149
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:45.633
- Wow! Wigglytuff’s so awesome!
- Na-na-na!

150
00:09:45.699 --> 00:09:48.000
Yeah. That’s who the book is about.

151
00:09:48.066 --> 00:09:52.766
It tells the story of something that apparently happened right here.

152
00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:57.533
Long ago, when there was a mass outbreak of rampaging Flygon,

153
00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:04.133
a lone Wigglytuff appeared and single-handedly pacified their anger!

154
00:10:08.266 --> 00:10:09.333
Afterward...

155
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:14.100
Wigglytuff healed every injured Pokémon in the village.

156
00:10:15.166 --> 00:10:17.933
- Wigglytuff’s cool!
- Na-na-na-na!

157
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.000
A healer! Awesome!

158
00:10:20.066 --> 00:10:22.533
Right and that tale is just one of the reasons

159
00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.400
that Wigglytuff came to be assistants at Pokémon Centers

160
00:10:25.466 --> 00:10:27.533
all through the Kalos region, see?

161
00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.800
- Amazing!
- Pika!

162
00:10:29.866 --> 00:10:31.866
Don’t worry! I’m absolutely sure

163
00:10:31.933 --> 00:10:35.333
that our Wigglytuff will get used to things and become great at its job.

164
00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.000
Me, too! That’s for sure! Besides, you’re here to help!

165
00:10:40.533 --> 00:10:45.433
Thanks very much. With such a kind heart, Wigglytuff is sure to succeed.

166
00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.333
Mistakes are always part of a new job, but things will be fine.

167
00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:52.533
I’ll wait patiently while doing everything I possibly can

168
00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.199
to help Wigglytuff learn at its own pace.

169
00:10:55.266 --> 00:10:57.766
Wigglytuff!

170
00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.033
- Huh?
- Wiggly, Wigglytuff!

171
00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.133
Wiggly, Wigglytuff!

172
00:11:03.199 --> 00:11:06.166
Yes. You’re already trying really hard!

173
00:11:06.233 --> 00:11:08.633
Wigglytuff!

174
00:11:08.699 --> 00:11:13.100
- Now...
- Wigglytuff!

175
00:11:21.433 --> 00:11:24.166
All ready to go?

176
00:11:24.233 --> 00:11:27.000
Clemontic Gear on!

177
00:11:27.066 --> 00:11:30.199
This is my Mechanized Motivator!

178
00:11:30.266 --> 00:11:33.633
My device will help you be motivated to get up and go!

179
00:11:33.699 --> 00:11:37.966
Please, allow me to demonstrate. Bonnie, would you be my assistant?

180
00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:39.400
Yeah. Okay!

181
00:11:39.466 --> 00:11:42.266
When you put it on, it automatically engages.

182
00:11:48.133 --> 00:11:52.166
Get up and go! Get up and go! Get up and go! Get up and go!

183
00:11:52.233 --> 00:11:53.500
Go! Go!

184
00:11:53.566 --> 00:11:57.233
It utilizes a miniature cheerleader that I’ve built in!

185
00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:01.033
It’s for those who’ve lost their confidence to cheer them on!

186
00:12:03.866 --> 00:12:06.300
Huh? What? You don’t like it?

187
00:12:06.366 --> 00:12:08.833
Uh, that’s enough, Clemont.

188
00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:12.600
- Well, I think it’s pretty cool.
- Pika! Pika!

189
00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.766
Tuff! Wigglytuff!

190
00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:17.800
Wigglytuff? Sure! You’re up next!

191
00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.366
Get up and go! Get up and go! Get up and go! Get up and go!

192
00:12:23.433 --> 00:12:25.766
Get up and go! Go, go, go, go!

193
00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.300
Clemont! Make it stop!

194
00:12:30.366 --> 00:12:33.500
Quickly! You’ve got to press the off button!

195
00:12:34.633 --> 00:12:37.766
-Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

196
00:12:37.833 --> 00:12:39.900
Pika!

197
00:12:42.766 --> 00:12:44.966
-Pika!

198
00:12:45.033 --> 00:12:47.033
- Pikachu!
- Wigglytuff!

199
00:12:49.966 --> 00:12:52.266
The get up and go got up and went.

200
00:13:00.766 --> 00:13:03.699
- Huh?
- Another ambulance?

201
00:13:05.033 --> 00:13:06.900
We happened to be in the area.

202
00:13:06.966 --> 00:13:09.333
We heard an explosion, so here we are!

203
00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:13.500
- Bring us your injured, right away!
- That explosion was not what you think.

204
00:13:13.566 --> 00:13:16.233
It may have been really loud, but nobody got hurt!

205
00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:20.233
We’re professionals and we’ll decide who got hurt. Just leave it to us!

206
00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.233
- Tuff?
- Injured party on the scene! Quick!

207
00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.666
Huh?

208
00:13:24.733 --> 00:13:28.000
Hey! What are you guys going to do with them?

209
00:13:31.599 --> 00:13:33.533
Ha!

210
00:13:33.599 --> 00:13:36.266
Prepare for trouble, you know what we’ll do!

211
00:13:36.333 --> 00:13:38.533
And make it a double Pokémon coup!

212
00:13:38.599 --> 00:13:41.033
To protect the world from devastation!

213
00:13:41.099 --> 00:13:43.833
To unite all people within our nation!

214
00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.933
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

215
00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:50.333
To extend our reach to the stars above!

216
00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.699
- Jessie!
- And James!

217
00:13:52.766 --> 00:13:55.699
Team Rocket’s on the scene at the speed of light!

218
00:13:55.766 --> 00:13:58.766
Surrender now or prepare for a five-alarm fight!

219
00:13:58.833 --> 00:14:01.533
Meowth, that’s right!

220
00:14:02.633 --> 00:14:03.866
Team Rocket!

221
00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:06.633
Many thanks for healing Meowth and Pumpkaboo!

222
00:14:06.699 --> 00:14:10.266
And to express our evil gratitude, we’ll now grab Pikachu!

223
00:14:10.333 --> 00:14:13.633
There’s no chance of that. Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

224
00:14:13.699 --> 00:14:17.966
Pikachu!

225
00:14:18.033 --> 00:14:19.533
Such silly twerps!

226
00:14:19.599 --> 00:14:22.500
When it comes to Electric-type moves, we’re prepared!

227
00:14:22.566 --> 00:14:25.199
So have a nice day, as if we cared!

228
00:14:25.266 --> 00:14:27.266
Contact!

229
00:14:28.266 --> 00:14:31.066
- Pikachu!
- Wigglytuff!

230
00:14:31.133 --> 00:14:33.400
The Pokémon Center has an ambulance.

231
00:14:33.466 --> 00:14:35.066
- Let’s follow them!
- Right!

232
00:14:35.133 --> 00:14:38.833
We did it! We did it! Pikachu is finally ours!

233
00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:41.133
We’re truly ambulatory!

234
00:14:41.199 --> 00:14:44.266
Yeah! The Boss will love us for our guts and glory!

235
00:14:49.266 --> 00:14:50.533
Look at the blob!

236
00:14:50.599 --> 00:14:52.900
- Look, mac! Out of the way!
- Today!

237
00:14:56.733 --> 00:14:58.500
Salamence?

238
00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:02.199
Uh! Could it be?

239
00:15:02.266 --> 00:15:05.766
Back in the cave when I tried to use...

240
00:15:05.833 --> 00:15:08.300
The Happy Face Hypnosis Machine?

241
00:15:08.366 --> 00:15:10.300
We know what that means!

242
00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.766
That Salamence!

243
00:15:16.833 --> 00:15:19.133
- Defense!
- Yeah! Reverse!

244
00:15:27.833 --> 00:15:29.766
- Pika!
- Tuff!

245
00:15:43.333 --> 00:15:46.266
- Wigglytuff! Wigglytuff!
- Pika!

246
00:15:50.599 --> 00:15:52.199
Pika!

247
00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:01.800
- Pikachu!
- Wigglytuff!

248
00:16:01.866 --> 00:16:03.333
You okay, buddy?

249
00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.866
Oh! Thank goodness you’re all right!

250
00:16:05.933 --> 00:16:07.400
-Huh?

251
00:16:07.466 --> 00:16:08.933
It’s a Salamence!

252
00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.933
Could that be the one who attacked Teddiursa?

253
00:16:14.966 --> 00:16:18.633
- Help us, twerps!
- We’re scared out of our wits!

254
00:16:18.699 --> 00:16:20.900
And all because we gave it a Happy Face!

255
00:16:20.966 --> 00:16:22.199
What’s that mean?

256
00:16:22.266 --> 00:16:25.066
We tried to catch Salamence and failed!

257
00:16:25.133 --> 00:16:27.800
Our Happy Face Hypnosis Machine’s a dud!

258
00:16:27.866 --> 00:16:32.366
Hypnosis machine? That must be the thing that’s stuck on its forehead!

259
00:16:32.433 --> 00:16:35.300
- It’s going crazy!

260
00:16:35.366 --> 00:16:37.800
What a bad thing to do!

261
00:16:37.866 --> 00:16:42.566
We’re going to have to do something to help it. and right away!

262
00:16:42.633 --> 00:16:46.000
Huh?

263
00:16:52.366 --> 00:16:55.500
Poor Salamence!

264
00:16:55.566 --> 00:16:59.033
You’re in pain!

265
00:16:59.099 --> 00:17:02.599
Don’t worry. I’ll help you! Just stay calm!

266
00:17:05.666 --> 00:17:08.266
- Nurse Joy!
- It’s too dangerous!

267
00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:09.700
Get away!

268
00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.333
Tuff!

269
00:17:20.399 --> 00:17:24.399
Wigglytuff, I wish you’d be more careful.

270
00:17:24.466 --> 00:17:25.933
Wiggly!

271
00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.800
- It will become great at its job.
- Wigglytuff!

272
00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:32.833
Tuff!

273
00:17:36.966 --> 00:17:38.333
- Tuff!
- Wigglytuff!

274
00:17:38.399 --> 00:17:41.833
- Huh? Wigglytuff!
- Nurse Joy!

275
00:17:41.899 --> 00:17:46.300
-Nurse Joy! Come on!

276
00:17:46.366 --> 00:17:47.833
Wigglytuff!

277
00:17:47.899 --> 00:17:50.766
Wigglytuff!

278
00:18:02.233 --> 00:18:05.666
- Wigglytuff!
- Salamence’s moves aren’t doing a thing!

279
00:18:05.733 --> 00:18:08.666
Wow! It’s just like from the book!

280
00:18:11.933 --> 00:18:15.300
That’s it! Wigglytuff’s a Fairy type, right?

281
00:18:15.366 --> 00:18:18.500
Dragon-type moves have no effect on Fairy types!

282
00:18:18.566 --> 00:18:24.433
That’s why the Wigglytuff in the book was able to defeat all those Flygon!

283
00:18:28.366 --> 00:18:30.933
Wigglytuff!

284
00:18:44.233 --> 00:18:48.333
That's great! Wigglytuff’s Heal Pulse got Salamence feeling normal again!

285
00:18:48.399 --> 00:18:49.800
Ha-ha! Yes!

286
00:18:49.866 --> 00:18:52.166
Wigglytuff!

287
00:18:54.533 --> 00:18:56.700
All better!

288
00:19:05.333 --> 00:19:07.800
I don’t see any other injuries.

289
00:19:09.566 --> 00:19:11.399
- Awesome!
- Pikachu!

290
00:19:11.466 --> 00:19:13.100
Thanks to Wigglytuff!

291
00:19:13.166 --> 00:19:16.266
- Wigglytuff, you were so awesome!
- Wigglytuff!

292
00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:19.833
- Well, that’s a relief.
- That was a close shave.

293
00:19:19.899 --> 00:19:22.000
I thought I was talking toast.

294
00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:32.666
- We’re blasting...
- Off...

295
00:19:32.733 --> 00:19:35.633
Again!

296
00:19:51.833 --> 00:19:55.333
Because of all of you, everybody’s just fine now. Thanks!

297
00:19:55.399 --> 00:19:56.466
Wigglytuff!

298
00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:00.633
We didn’t do anything. It’s all thanks to Wigglytuff!

299
00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.233
- Pikachu!
- Right! You were really amazing!

300
00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.966
Wigglytuff!

301
00:20:05.033 --> 00:20:07.833
Wigglytuff? Next time I’m in a pinch like that,

302
00:20:07.899 --> 00:20:11.233
I really hope you’ll help me out again. I’m depending on you!

303
00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:15.966
Wiggly! Wigglytuff!

304
00:20:16.033 --> 00:20:17.700
Oh! -Wigglytuff?

305
00:20:17.766 --> 00:20:21.933
- Please don’t cry!
- Pikachu!

306
00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:26.166
- Tuff! Wiggly! Tuff!
- Pika! Pika!

307
00:20:26.233 --> 00:20:28.233
- Pika! Pika!
- Wigglytuff

308
00:20:29.333 --> 00:20:31.633
After overcoming its anxiety,

309
00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:35.366
Wigglytuff is sure to make a great assistant for Nurse Joy.

310
00:20:35.433 --> 00:20:38.300
And soon, our heroes will again set a course

311
00:20:38.366 --> 00:20:44.366
for Coumarine City and Ash's next Gym battle, as the journey continues!
